{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "04bcd5780a0c36c3823a15489c5d71994af3d6981120304fcb10f37e094c6563", "ja": "ふたりのせんせい", "zh": "两位老师", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ea19c65113eecc495fb282f7966a9209637dd83a921f68ce5ca1790cfd1fdafd", "ja": "瑞希の提案により、劇場でひまりのための\n勉強会が開かれる。瑞希はひまりと桃子に\n算数を教え、桃子はひまりに新曲のダンスを\n教える。すっかり打ち解けた様子に、もう\n大丈夫だと確信するプロデューサー。", "zh": "应瑞希的提议，剧场为ひまり举办了学习会。瑞希教ひまり和桃子算术，桃子则教ひまり跳新曲的舞蹈。看到她们已经完全熟络起来的样子，制作人确信这下已经没问题了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "89e8e8da7d2f512bb58fd3e12b3de2859b767e3fc5f4c0c22c79d72e51a3a8c2", "ja": "（仕事で勉強が遅れがちだというひまりさんのため、\n瑞希が勉強会を提案。流石瑞希、いいアイディアだ）", "zh": "（为了因工作而经常耽误学习的日葵，瑞希提议举办学习会。不愧是瑞希，真是个好主意。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "138c72f76e1703e88b51003f8ba164fdb860df0d623e54a2cffba36d603c396f", "ja": "（マネージャーさんに許可をもらい、\nさっそく、ひまりさんが劇場にやってきた）", "zh": "（得到经纪人的许可后，日葵马上来到了剧场。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "452973a1fc12b3e8b0dcd06d63b019a465b7b3831943819277d9959ea43cea5d", "ja": "ようこそ、ひまりちゃん。\nここが765プロライブ劇場だよ！", "zh": "欢迎你，日茉莉。\n这里就是765事务所剧场哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "7650cbec3b989dc23f12b79f57c95b0383cc4cd60ac815bd5666acf7d1eef4c7", "ja": "今日は一日オフだと聞きました。\nゆっくり取り組みましょうね。", "zh": "听说你今天一整天都有空。\n我们慢慢来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1004_p", "source_sha256": "e5160740c4d6accb26d78515532c3cff0b27a1d61ae37d93f43f646c0e562fb6", "ja": "みんなにも、話はしてあるので。劇場の中は、\n好きなように見学してもらって構いませんよ。", "zh": "我也已经和大家说过了。剧场里面，您可以随意参观。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1005_himari", "source_sha256": "369e1e6f3228206b32b4c9d068dea464c7d57ea734bc6c3d13536d0f52cfa952", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\nでも、今日はべんきょうをしにきたので。", "zh": "谢谢。\n不过，我今天是为了来学习的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "17cff9dedb560cad6ab455a1763cd719786770e114d822b34334b6b5f888f151", "ja": "最初はゲームでリフレッシュと考えていましたが……\nひまりさんは真面目なんですね。", "zh": "一开始我还以为是想通过游戏放松一下，不过……Himari很认真呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2fc9ea02d613f4290374e2b0c8f794962d4e5f3f3e3ef5e56ad61cf380159144", "ja": "この分なら心配はなさそうかな。じゃあ、事務室で\n仕事をしてるから、何かあったら声をかけてくれ。", "zh": "照这样看来，应该不用担心了。那我先在办公室工作，有什么事就叫我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "89ca7e8d8fae1e97774fdf131c137ae19697d573f8c0665ad416f82c3d0d4ba4", "ja": "わかりました。それでは、早速始めましょうか。\nわからないところは、何でも聞いてください。", "zh": "好的。那么，我们就赶紧开始吧。\n有什么不懂的地方，请尽管问我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "e91c2b2d1e9bc265b89b76805d775fa47cfc2d3ec70777309245495634cd1124", "ja": "会議室をとってあるから、そこでやろう。\nこっちだよ！", "zh": "我已经订好会议室了，就在那里做吧。\n这边！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1010_himari", "source_sha256": "97868616eceae54cd5d6376720e3319e2bccbf1e0c3ca9fb6cde966391db44e9", "ja": "んー……。\nすうじ……見てるとこんらんします……。", "zh": "嗯……  \n一看数字……就会糊涂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "62277915fdbe9448e1e266a7b4ecdec3117d32d43f71cb09609c7f1a01d82d19", "ja": "数字にピンとこないなら、\n動物さんに置き換えるのはどうでしょう？", "zh": "要是对数字没有什么感觉，\n换成小动物来想怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "63570b74d342766d18c8a11ba2c06d85ee9d5a55bdf20ee7ecbebf5d1d49a4c1", "ja": "たとえば……ゴリラさんが5つ、\nおさるさんが3つなら……。", "zh": "比如说……大猩猩有5只，小猴子有3只的话……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1013_himari", "source_sha256": "d569290001fd32928c00557b860e18a86590af749f83063f15e4720532822205", "ja": "それなら……8つ！", "zh": "那样的话……8个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "9e7fc9306f621ab487a234bb727b0e81a4a0733c8723b2157649939bc7722005", "ja": "正解です。解くスピードが速くなっているので、\n繰り返しの成果が出ていますね。", "zh": "回答正确。你解题的速度变快了，反复练习已经见成效了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "aa9c6b7d51f3e688179912593de3c6bf25c68011fca4eea21a49af2839bef117", "ja": "周防さんの方は……算数の宿題ですか？", "zh": "周防同学那边……是在做算术作业吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "5a9aa69199e346dd9372bc6102b5c8a3431fc8ef90c1b3b147ad3a12a40d9de0", "ja": "うん。計算問題はいいけど、\n図形の問題が……。", "zh": "嗯。计算题还好，可是几何题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "30564a4e4679ab3ab653eeff10149d19dc8a990b0bd3ba663a972bbe34e8b43e", "ja": "これは、習ったことで答えが出せるはずです。\n三角形の内角の和はわかりますか？", "zh": "这道题应该可以用学过的知识解出来。\n你知道三角形内角和是多少吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "50e8a05cef7060138910f16d36af67194291c62bfd01c5a4abc650a56301667f", "ja": "えっと……180。あっ、それなら\nここと反対の角度が求められるから……。", "zh": "呃……180。啊，这样的话，就能求出与这里相对的角度了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "0d60d1e0541911b624dd5943649e37233e6ea11363ae9d8505bcf63f40e28872", "ja": "はい。習ったことがどういう問題に役立つか、\nこれも繰り返しで身についていくはずですよ。", "zh": "是的。学到的知识能解决什么样的问题，这些也应该能在一次次练习中逐渐掌握。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1020_049mom", "source_sha256": "2612c2b8189f0c7c067a3777be86fee88bbbc84d1a21abbb531706896faafb0f", "ja": "瑞希さんて、頭がいいだけじゃなくて、\n教え方もすごく上手だよね。さすがって感じ。", "zh": "瑞希小姐不仅聪明，教得也特别好呢。真不愧是她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1021_himari", "source_sha256": "cfd6e8fe509af250fe1755e2b6cb8f9692ad94c36d0764d9d65c2bd7d562b2e0", "ja": "あたまのいいひと、\nあこがれます……。", "zh": "很憧憬聪明的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1022_044miz", "source_sha256": "484319ca574ccbecd56ce58f3773be045cefacd60e275cbafeae76a3dd7117d3", "ja": "はっ。ふたりの視線が、なんだか熱い……。\nこれが、俗にいう……モテ期？", "zh": "啊。两个人的视线，好像有点炽热……这就是俗话说的……桃花期？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1023_044miz", "source_sha256": "888519f3231acac5b369bef60b99ddc553eb643dfcddb94a42eaf7e15b5c63f4", "ja": "おふたりとも、宿題に限らず、わからないことは何でも\n聞いてください。……瑞希先生におまかせ、だぞ。", "zh": "两位，不只是作业，有什么不明白的都请尽管问我。……交给瑞希老师，没问题哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1024_se", "source_sha256": "fa58af4f0361da4ef749bac0a00d6a1b0f2295a1d5c686590a1d817bd54d2cdc", "ja": "ザワザワ……", "zh": "一阵骚动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1025_himari", "source_sha256": "650e3ce11766233929c836bbaea7c3b91c7700a582a8c29f2d4b533b4215c1ea", "ja": "？　へやの外から、\nたくさんのひとのこえがします……。", "zh": "？从房间外面传来了好多人的声音……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1026_049mom", "source_sha256": "13fd64c4ef1faba0225ea48536842e3d2fbf6c4270960fba4688e46ff520816b", "ja": "あ、この時間だから……\nみんなのレッスンが終わったんだね。", "zh": "啊，因为已经到这个时间了……\n大家的练习结束了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1027_himari", "source_sha256": "f97766ab39b338c4a9c32a550d8b779f7c6031d28376d9df39412e6e9f23623e", "ja": "レッスン……。", "zh": "训练……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1028_049mom", "source_sha256": "df6fd44d2dc98b5a8323b79e9765b04d74edfb4dbd412844463448e969ab9bbf", "ja": "そう。桃子たちは、アイドルだからね。\n毎日ここで、いろんな練習をしてるんだよ。", "zh": "对呀。桃子她们可是偶像。\n每天都在这里进行各种各样的练习呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1029_044miz", "source_sha256": "6726240e6477c7f6d53d2eb82d92372c5c292d53c79d163195c20e68d5902754", "ja": "そういえば……あのシャンプーのCMには、\n私たちの曲が使われる予定なんですよ。", "zh": "说起来……那支洗发水广告预定会使用我们的歌曲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1030_himari", "source_sha256": "5bc94186cbdb8152bdc744c2fe89ad38f518bb78e43a76a15ecc7e3522ad1476", "ja": "えっ、そうなの！？\nきいてみたい！　……です。", "zh": "诶，是这样的吗！？\n我想听听！……嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1031_044miz", "source_sha256": "4b874e3752a085eb935ff9ab2ec35c4d91132cf670eb8dd98e678ba734c77866", "ja": "それなら、デモ音源がありますよ。\n{$P$}に言えば、きっと……。", "zh": "那样的话，我这里有演示音源。\n去跟{$P$}说的话，一定……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1032_se", "source_sha256": "c01f9901aa06ad650b314d5a929022d1574a5f17402b31fd5bd6359592e719d6", "ja": "コンコン、ガチャ", "zh": "咚咚，咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1033_p", "source_sha256": "a1f208d3d29e6c4a23c99e393cdbd06ad0bcce76e699c289d7994a36dfe5294c", "ja": "内緒にしてくれるなら、聞いてもらって大丈夫だよ。\n瑞希、音源は持ってるか？", "zh": "只要你能替我保密，听一下也没关系。\n瑞希，你有音源吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1034_044miz", "source_sha256": "6ca4e8fa9d8c3c7c1bbdf4e755c38adb32388c276ba6c2d8ac2741c4151b62b8", "ja": "{$P$}。／お兄ちゃん！", "zh": "{$P$}。／哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1035_049mom", "source_sha256": "7dcf3a8755ce0cb1a298695fcaa203d85396249464925234e7817be8975d85be", "ja": "お兄ちゃん！", "zh": "大哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1036_p", "source_sha256": "f2c3eaff8fcc482b38f27fd0f1c8d7e9aed31b67c84ffdb84e7fd862c9d2e365", "ja": "みんな頑張ってるから、おやつを持ってきたんだ。\nはい、どうぞ！", "zh": "看到大家这么努力，我就带了点心过来。\n来，请用吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1037_049mom", "source_sha256": "ace028e1d3688eca4dc1e11e097346ce5032f61c408001dec90a5423068731a6", "ja": "別に、気を遣わなくてもいいのに。\n……これ、いつもよりいいお菓子じゃない？", "zh": "其实不用这么客气的。\n……这不是比平时的点心更好嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1038_p", "source_sha256": "f57630a166f51d13568d84c7b934ed17e3e4cd021ce1a1fc9afbbbcca0ab95d4", "ja": "い、いや、そんな事ない……と思うぞ！\nそれに、少しでもみんなの力になりたいなと思ってな。", "zh": "没、没有这回事……吧！\n而且，我也希望能多少帮上大家的忙嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1039_049mom", "source_sha256": "a78f7754e69f1599c7f3afeb0c2d63f08b1020812955be341cf148589f2e1f1f", "ja": "そんなの……別に、じゅうぶんでしょ。\nこの前だって、桃子の話、聞いてくれたし……。", "zh": "那样……已经够了吧。前几天，你不也听桃子说了那么多吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1040_p", "source_sha256": "a4868bbcef3a212d91e5915327b474908d2965f3189436562c2a2b44a542f528", "ja": "当然、聞くぞ！\n桃子の話なら、いつでもいくらでも……。", "zh": "那是当然要听的！\n只要是桃子的事，无论何时、无论说多少我都……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1041_049mom", "source_sha256": "2bc1a6bd8b77ada67d26f5d80c66170f0a668d532cad17f4a7749a0496c6f5d4", "ja": "も、もう、今のは聞かなくてもいいの！\n瑞希さん、曲かけて！", "zh": "真是的，刚才那句不用听啦！\n瑞希小姐，放音乐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1042_044miz", "source_sha256": "858834d853c2cce26202df4ed998368136d61258a349806bb308f87342f5596b", "ja": "わかりました。\nそれでは……ポチッ。", "zh": "好的。\n那么……按下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1044_044miz", "source_sha256": "3f591dfb6c53254008138ce3e781fe77a1bdd9045ea589416c57df6277a92da2", "ja": "Chu-chu-ru-chu、Pa-ya-pa……\n……出だしから、とってもかわいいぞ。", "zh": "Chu-chu-ru-chu、Pa-ya-pa……\n……一开头就非常可爱呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1045_049mom", "source_sha256": "0eeab101b3543bb13a7125e8873f2057b5a112af3bb70bd646e7469544d8f908", "ja": "うん、最後までずっとかわいい曲だよね♪\nダンスもね、こうやってステップを踏んで……。", "zh": "嗯，直到最后都是首超级可爱的歌呢♪\n舞蹈也是这样踩着步子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1046_himari", "source_sha256": "a762626c64cb3c6e1ca26b4954cb9cc33784796d5d1a958dd1fe8aa455a023c2", "ja": "ちゅっちゅるちゅ……ぱやぱ……\nえいっ！　ふふっ♪", "zh": "啾啾啾……啪呀啪……\n嘿！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1047_044miz", "source_sha256": "d0022ce4e9c3f1f3b93578efe28dc6d5a623c823570226171a90212ebc1435a3", "ja": "おや……。\nひまりさん、なかなかダンスの筋がいいですね。", "zh": "哦呀……。\n向日葵小姐很有跳舞的天分呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1048_p", "source_sha256": "15dd4e43679ca8689df59db5651eef8963753dcefe6d7f1c99043bc79f697b56", "ja": "うん、リズム感があるな。", "zh": "嗯，很有节奏感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1049_himari", "source_sha256": "5b99506ce481af4fdb704ec82f9f3a061c457b75a05b6720d43616c819b33bce", "ja": "ほ、ほんとう？\nダンス、やってみたい！　おしえてください！", "zh": "真、真的吗？\n我想试试跳舞！请教我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1050_049mom", "source_sha256": "3d4f22a8feda6375b088ea092bcaa2b25ebd6818bd0345154814edf39220adcc", "ja": "それじゃあ、今度は桃子が先生してあげる！\nダンス、よく見ててね……！", "zh": "那么这次就由桃子来当老师教你吧！\n好好看着桃子的舞蹈哦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1051_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1052_manager", "source_sha256": "d9e67882f50e5855662739a4c361a925b48d85abd5fceef46e0c02dd64608c0a", "ja": "今日はホントにありがとうございました。\n勉強以外に、歌やダンスまで教えて頂いたそうで……", "zh": "今天真的非常感谢您。\n听说您除了学习以外，还教了唱歌和跳舞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1053_manager", "source_sha256": "3ee9150a2ce209b261ace97e173e4a7c274abe9f74ad7a753b385fa2b9ca8055", "ja": "ひまりのこんなに楽しそうな顔は、\n本当に久しぶりに見ました。", "zh": "我还是头一次见到向日葵露出这么开心的表情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1054_044miz", "source_sha256": "dde724a12fbebab06eb0e82a56a50767d040a978ca8865dccf91b3f9d42a9414", "ja": "いいえ。ひまりさん、とてもいい子でした。\n私たちも、とても楽しかったです。", "zh": "不。向日葵小姐是个非常乖的孩子。\n我们也玩得非常开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1055_049mom", "source_sha256": "2a76fbe184482595ad527a77d571c81fb3e150164a6df91e7f7e3b93393a5f65", "ja": "うん。ダンスの見直しにもなったし。\nひまりちゃん、次の撮影、がんばろうね！", "zh": "嗯。而且也能重新审视自己的舞蹈。\n日葵，下次拍摄要一起加油哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1056_himari", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_05_1057_p", "source_sha256": "abe9c8e7c3565abd43795d76deb35015881d887f4d6d426641dfdfce0ec8c78a", "ja": "（勉強だけでなく、色々な勉強会になったみたいだ。\nこれだけ打ち解けられたなら、もう大丈夫だろう！）", "zh": "（看来不只是学习，还成了各种各样的学习会。\n既然已经亲近到这种程度，应该就没问题了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
